<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CareerPilot — Your AI Career Copilot</title>
<meta name="description" content="CareerPilot helps you turn your experience into better job applications.">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--bg:#f7f8fc;--card:#fff;--text:#111827;--muted:#667085;--line:#e7e9ee;--accent:#6d5dfc;--accent2:#5145e5}
body{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.5}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.nav{height:72px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 7%;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5;backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:20px}.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b7cff,#5145e5);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-size:18px}
.navlinks{display:flex;gap:26px;color:#667085;font-size:14px}.navlinks a:hover{color:#111827}
.navbtn{background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px}
.hero{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:90px 24px 65px;text-align:center}
.pill{display:inline-flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;background:#eeecff;color:#5548df;border:1px solid #ddd8ff;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:.98;margin:22px auto 20px;max-width:900px}
.gradient{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5145e5,#8a72ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero p{max-width:650px;margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:18px}
.hero-actions{margin-top:30px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.primary,.secondary{border:0;padding:14px 21px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(109,93,252,.22)}.secondary{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);color:#202536}
.demo{max-width:1050px;margin:0 auto 85px;padding:0 24px}.panel{background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:0 20px 55px rgba(20,25,50,.08);overflow:hidden}
.paneltop{padding:17px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#d7d9e0}.paneltitle{margin-left:8px;color:#667085;font-size:13px}
.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:360px}.upload{padding:38px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.results{padding:38px;background:#fbfbfe}
.sectionlabel{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:800;color:#8a91a3;margin-bottom:10px}
h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-bottom:10px}.muted{color:var(--muted)}
.drop{margin-top:24px;border:2px dashed #d9d7ef;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 20px;text-align:center;background:#fafaff;cursor:pointer}.drop:hover{border-color:#a79fff}
.drop strong{display:block;margin:8px 0 4px}.drop small{color:#8a91a3}
.score{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin:24px 0}.circle{width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(var(--accent) 0 78%,#e9eaf1 78%);display:grid;place-items:center}.circle:after{content:"78%";width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900}
.checks{display:grid;gap:10px}.check{padding:11px 13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;font-size:13px}.check span{color:#25a26b;font-weight:900;margin-right:7px}
.features{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px 90px}.features h2{text-align:center;font-size:38px;margin-bottom:12px}.features>p{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:40px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:25px;border-radius:17px}.icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;background:#eeecff;color:#5b4ee8;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:18px}.card h3{margin-bottom:7px}.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.cta{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto 80px;padding:0 24px}.cta-inner{background:#121426;color:white;border-radius:24px;padding:55px;text-align:center}.cta h2{font-size:40px}.cta p{color:#b8bdcf;margin:10px auto 25px;max-width:570px}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#8a91a3;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:760px){.navlinks{display:none}.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.upload{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cta-inner{padding:35px 22px}.hero{padding-top:65px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav">
<a class="brand" href="#"><span class="logo">✦</span>CareerPilot</a>
<div class="navlinks"><a href="#how">How it works</a><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#start">Get started</a></div>
<a class="navbtn" href="#start">Try free</a>
</nav>
<main>
<section class="hero" id="start">
<div class="pill">✦ Your AI career copilot</div>
<h1>Stop applying blindly.<br><span class="gradient">Start applying smarter.</span></h1>
<p>CareerPilot analyzes your experience, matches you with opportunities, and helps you create stronger applications — all in one place.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><button class="primary" onclick="document.getElementById('cv').click()">Analyze my CV →</button><a class="secondary" href="#features">See how it works</a></div>
</section>
<section class="demo" id="how">
<div class="panel">
<div class="paneltop"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="paneltitle">CareerPilot workspace</span></div>
<div class="workspace">
<div class="upload">
<div class="sectionlabel">Step 01</div><h2>Upload your CV</h2><p class="muted">We'll use it to understand your experience and find your strongest career opportunities.</p>
<input id="cv" type="file" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx" hidden onchange="handleFile(this)">
<label class="drop" for="cv"><div style="font-size:28px">↑</div><strong id="fileText">Drop your CV here</strong><small>PDF, DOC or DOCX</small></label>
</div>
<div class="results">
<div class="sectionlabel">AI preview</div><h2>Your career snapshot</h2><p class="muted">A preview of what CareerPilot will generate.</p>
<div class="score"><div class="circle"></div><div><strong>Application readiness</strong><p class="muted">Strong foundation. A few improvements could increase your match rate.</p></div></div>
<div class="checks"><div class="check"><span>✓</span>Experience clearly communicates your strengths</div><div class="check"><span>✓</span>Transferable skills identified</div><div class="check"><span>✓</span>Personalized application strategy ready</div></div>
</div>
</div></div>
</section>
<section class="features" id="features">
<h2>Everything you need to move forward.</h2><p>One intelligent workspace for the entire job search.</p>
<div class="grid">
<article class="card"><div class="icon">⌕</div><h3>Find better matches</h3><p>Discover roles that fit your skills, experience and career goals instead of endlessly scrolling job boards.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">✎</div><h3>Tailor every application</h3><p>Turn your existing experience into targeted CVs, cover letters and application answers.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">◎</div><h3>Know your fit</h3><p>See why you're a strong match, where you're missing requirements and what to improve next.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>Prepare for interviews</h3><p>Practice realistic interview questions and get feedback before the real conversation.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">✓</div><h3>Track applications</h3><p>Keep every application organized so promising opportunities never get lost.</p></article>
<article class="card"><div class="icon">★</div><h3>Build your career</h3><p>Get personalized suggestions for skills and actions that can increase your future opportunities.</p></article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta"><div class="cta-inner"><h2>Your next opportunity starts here.</h2><p>Build a smarter job search with an AI copilot designed around your career.</p><button class="primary" onclick="document.getElementById('cv').click()">Analyze my CV →</button></div></section>
</main>
<footer><span>© 2026 CareerPilot</span><span>Built to make job searching less painful.</span></footer>
<script>
function handleFile(input){const name=input.files&&input.files[0]?input.files[0].name:"Drop your CV here";document.getElementById("fileText").textContent=name;}
</script>
</body>
</html>
